    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d856">

                <pb facs="0832" n="734" sameAs="frus:frus1900/pg734"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Baron Fava to Mr.
                            Hay.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Translation.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1900-07-30"><hi rendition="#italic">July 30,
                        1900</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Mr. Secretary of State</hi>: With the most intense
                    grief I discharge the sad duty of announcing to your excellency that His Majesty
                    King Humbert died last night, the 29th instant, a victim of an infamous
                    assault.</p>
                <p>I have the honor to beg your excellency to be pleased to impart this mournful
                    intelligence to the President of the United States.</p>
                <p>His Majesty King Victor Emanuel III is now at Piresus, whence he is about to
                    return to the Kingdom.</p>
                <p>Accept, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Fava.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
